# https://dvc.org/doc/user-guide/dvcignore

# Keep the sensitive one-off restored backup archive (raw prompt dumps that may
# contain secrets) out of DVC's view. The pipeline reads only data/raw/*.jsonl.
prompt-intent-classifier/data/Prompt-Intent-Classification-Data-*/
prompt-intent-classifier/data/*.zip
